    <string name="welcome_title">Welcome to Nezumi AI</string>
    <string name="welcome_message"> How to use:
• Sidebar: open chat history and menus
• Chat screen: talk with the AI
• Settings: download models and set tokens

 Initial setup:
1. On the Model tab, run "HuggingFace token auth"
2. Download a model (Gemma 4 2B is recommended)

 Other:
• "License" shows information about the open-source libraries used

Enjoy chatting with your AI!</string>

